		(property "Description" "u-blox NINA-B111 stand-alone Bluetooth 5.0 low energy module with NFC, external-antenna pin (ANT, 50 ohm, no on-module antenna -- NINA-B112 has the antenna instead), 27 free GPIO + SWD/SWO + EGP, LGA/castellated-edge package 10.6x10.0x2.2mm (42 land pattern incl. EGP thermal sub-pads). Pin numbers and functions verified directly against the real u-blox NINA-B1 series datasheet UBX-15019243-R15 Table 6 'NINA-B1 series pinout' (all 30 signal pins + EGP). Footprint pad geometry taken directly from u-blox's own official Eagle CAD library (github.com/u-blox/CadSoft-Eagle-Library, ubloxLib.lbr, package NINA111-42) rather than hand-transcribed from the mechanical drawing -- cross-validated against the datasheet's own mechanical table (Table 19): body 10.6x10.0mm, lateral pin pitch 1.0mm, central/EGP pin pitch 1.15mm all match exactly between the two independent sources."
