				)
				(hide yes)
			)
		)
		(property "Description" "u-blox NINA-B400 stand-alone Bluetooth 5.1 Low Energy open-CPU module, Nordic nRF52833 (Arm Cortex-M4F, 512 kB flash / 128 kB RAM), 2.4 GHz BLE + IEEE 802.15.4 + proprietary modes, +8 dBm conducted TX, -95 dBm RX sensitivity (-102 dBm long-range 125 kbps). B400 variant carries an ON-MODULE U.FL antenna connector -- no external match network or U.FL receptacle is needed on the host PCB, and pin 13 ANT is NC (internally tied to module GND). Module 15.0 x 10.0 x 2.23 mm, 55 signal pins + EGP (Exposed Ground Pins) + EAGP (Exposed Antenna Ground Pins). VCC 1.7-3.6 V, abs-max 3.9 V. Pin numbers, names and functions verified directly against the real u-blox NINA-B40 series data sheet UBX-19049405 R09, Table 6 'NINA-B40 series pinout' (all 55 pins) and Figure 3 'NINA-B40 series pin assignment (top view)'. NOTE: NINA-B4 is pin/mechanically compatible with NINA-B3 (datasheet section 1.2), NOT with the NINA-B1 series this project previously used -- the B111 42-pad land pattern does not apply."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
				(hide yes)
			)
		)
